  "details": "when I open up the iOS mobile app from getting a push notification, I click on it only to be presented with a screen that doesn’t really tell me anything about the notification.\n\nI absolutely love group and getting them outside of VR chat would be really cool so that way it would incentivize me to get into VR\n\nBut as a currently stands with the iOS app during beta, I get the notification I tap the notification and I get presented with the play screen with no information about what that notification was.\n\nIt would be really cool if there was a really comprehensive notification center that would tell me exactly what’s going on with the group notifications almost as a secondary social factor or quite simply takes me directly to the webpage. You could be lazy if you wanted to be.\n\nBut I just wanted to point out that my experience right now of getting the notification in it going nowhere it’s kind of disappointing",
